{
    "chapter_num": 9,
    "verses_count": 44,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Priests and Levites in Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So all Israel was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "enrolled"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "recorded by genealogies, and indeed, they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " inscribed in the book of the kings of Israel. But Judah was carried away captive to Babylon because of their unfaithfulness. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the first inhabitants who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "dwelt"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in their possessions in their cities "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Israelites, priests, Levites, and the Nethinim."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Dwellers in Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now in Jerusalem the children of Judah dwelt, and some of the children of Benjamin, and of the children of Ephraim and Manasseh: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Uthai the son of Ammihud, the son of Omri, the son of Imri, the son of Bani, of the descendants of Perez, the son of Judah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the Shilonites: Asaiah the firstborn and his sons. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons of Zerah: Jeuel, and their brethren—six hundred and ninety. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the sons of Benjamin: Sallu the son of Meshullam, the son of Hodaviah, the son of Hassenuah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ibneiah the son of Jeroham; Elah the son of Uzzi, the son of Michri; Meshullam the son of Shephatiah, the son of Reuel, the son of Ibnijah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and their brethren, according to their generations—nine hundred and fifty-six. All these men "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " heads of a father’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in their fathers’ houses."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Priests at Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the priests: Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, and Jachin; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Seraiah, Neh. 11:11"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Azariah the son of Hilkiah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Zadok, the son of Meraioth, the son of Ahitub, the officer over the house of God; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Adaiah the son of Jeroham, the son of Pashur, the son of Malchijah; Maasai the son of Adiel, the son of Jahzerah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Meshillemith, the son of Immer; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and their brethren, heads of their fathers’ houses—one thousand seven hundred and sixty. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "They were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. mighty men of strength"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "very able men for the work of the service of the house of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Levites at Jerusalem"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the Levites: Shemaiah the son of Hasshub, the son of Azrikam, the son of Hashabiah, of the sons of Merari; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, and Mattaniah the son of Micah, the son of Zichri, the son of Asaph; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Obadiah the son of Shemaiah, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun; and Berechiah the son of Asa, the son of Elkanah, who lived in the villages of the Netophathites."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Levite Gatekeepers"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the gatekeepers "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, and their brethren. Shallum "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the chief. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Until then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they had been"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " gatekeepers for the camps of the children of Levi at the King’s Gate on the east."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shallum the son of Kore, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah, and his brethren, from his father’s house, the Korahites, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in charge of the work of the service, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. thresholds"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "gatekeepers of the tabernacle. Their fathers had been keepers of the entrance to the camp of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Phinehas the son of Eleazar had been the officer over them in time past; the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zechariah the son of Meshelemiah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "gatekeeper"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "keeper of the door of the tabernacle of meeting."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All those chosen as gatekeepers "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " two hundred and twelve. They were recorded by their genealogy, in their villages. David and Samuel the seer had appointed them to their trusted office. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they and their children "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in charge of the gates of the house of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", the house of the tabernacle, by assignment. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The gatekeepers were assigned to the four directions: the east, west, north, and south. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And their brethren in their villages "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "had"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to come with them from time to time for seven days. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in this trusted office "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " four chief gatekeepers; they were Levites. And they had charge over the chambers and treasuries of the house of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they lodged "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " around the house of God because "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "the watch was committed to them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "had"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the responsibility, and they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in charge of opening "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " every morning."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Other Levite Responsibilities"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of them were in charge of the serving vessels, for they brought them in and took them out by count. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of them "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " appointed over the furnishings and over all the implements of the sanctuary, and over the fine flour and the wine and the oil and the incense and the spices. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the sons of the priests made the ointment of the spices."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Mattithiah of the Levites, the firstborn of Shallum the Korahite, had the trusted office over the things that were baked in the pans. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And some of their brethren of the sons of the Kohathites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in charge of preparing the showbread for every Sabbath."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These are the singers, heads of the fathers’ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "houses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the Levites, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who lodged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the chambers, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " free "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "from other duties;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for they were employed in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " work day and night. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These heads of the fathers’ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "houses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the Levites "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " heads throughout their generations. They dwelt at Jerusalem."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of King Saul"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jeiel the father of Gibeon, whose wife’s name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Maacah, dwelt at Gibeon. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "His firstborn son "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abdon, then Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Gedor, Ahio, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Zecher, 1 Chr. 8:31"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zechariah, and Mikloth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Mikloth begot "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shimeah, 1 Chr. 8:32"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shimeam. They also dwelt alongside their relatives in Jerusalem, with their brethren. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ner begot Kish, Kish begot Saul, and Saul begot Jonathan, Malchishua, Abinadab, and Esh-Baal. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The son of Jonathan "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Merib-Baal, and Merib-Baal begot Micah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Micah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Pithon, Melech, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Tarea, 1 Chr. 8:35"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Tahrea, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with Arab., Syr., Tg., Vg. (cf. 8:35); MT, LXX omit and Ahaz"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ahaz. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Ahaz begot "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Jehoaddah, 1 Chr. 8:36"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jarah; Jarah begot Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri; and Zimri begot Moza; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moza begot Binea, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Raphah, 1 Chr. 8:37"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Rephaiah his son, Eleasah his son, and Azel his son."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Azel had six sons whose names "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " these: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan; these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of Azel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}